window.products.push({"id":82368,"name":"LG 6871JB1423N Genuine OEM Electronic Control Board for LG Refrigerators","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":155.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91w9PVzVOgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description This high quality LG OEM 6871JB1423N Electronic Control Board for LG brand Refrigerators is manufactured to exact specifications with durable materials. The Electronic Control Board is a PCBA (Printed Circuit Board Assembly) responsible for controling the different components within the refrigerator and allows for management of refrigerator funtions such as temperature control and defrost schedule. Please be aware that all utilities should be disconnected from your Refrigerator Appliance prior to replacing the Electronic Control Board. From the Manufacturer This is a genuine replacement part. The model number and name for the following item is: Main Control Board 6871JB1423N LG circuit board timer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91w9PVzVOgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LG","source_asin":"B01AJVXIFS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-82368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AJVXIFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AJVXIFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
