window.products.push({"id":82392,"name":"154430501 Dishwasher Door Springs Fits for Frigidaire Kenmore Crosley Westinghouse Gibson Tappan replaces AP3363442 1014399 154226001 154226002 154345","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S3n9dCvnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"154430501 Dishwasher Door Springs Fits for Frigidaire Kenmore Dishwasher replaces AP3363442 1014399 154226001 154226002 154345901(Pack Of 2 ) Product Description: Specification - 154430501 Dishwasher Door Springs 2 pcs,this measures 8\".   Replacment Part - Dishwasher Door Springs 154430501 part number replaces AP3363442 1014399 154226001 154226002 154345901 154345902 154413301 AH815938 EA815938 PS815938.  Fits Brand - Fit For Most Brand Dishwashers,include: Frigidaire Kenmore Sears Westinghouse Electrolux Kelvinator Gibson and others.  Please check the compatibility with your previous part and appliance's model before ordering this replacemen. Compatible With Most Frigidaire Dishwashers including CDB350NW5A CDB350NW6B CDB350NW7B CDB350NW8B CDB350NW9B CDB400KB0 CDB400KB0A CDB400KB1B CDB400KW0 CDB400KW0A CDB400KW1B CDB500CGB0 FBD2400KB0 FBD2400KB10B FBD2400KB11B FBD2400KB12B FBD2400KB2A FBD2400KB3A FBD2400KB4A.  Fix the problem - If your dishwasher door tends to loosen or lose its elasticity, you may need a new door spring to get your dishwasher back in working order, used to control the opening and closing of your dishwasher and prevent vibrations from damaging your dishes.  Instructions for use - Part No. 154430501 is a door spring for dishwashers. To prevent the dishwasher door from falling too quickly when you open it, the door spring applies tension to the dishwasher door through the door hinges. Also, because the spring is in tension, it may break, so be careful when installing the door spring. Please wear work gloves to protect your hands while servicing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S3n9dCvnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"savone","source_asin":"B0982BV3RD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-82392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0982BV3RD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0982BV3RD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":82393,"name":"Waterdrop Plus UKF8001 NSF 401, 53&42 Certified Refrigerator Water Filter, Compatible with Whirlpool Everydrop Filter 4, EDR4RXD1, Maytag UKF8001AXX-2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r8PzfpJxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Replacement models] Replacement for Whirlpool & Maytag UKF8001, Amana UKF8001, UKF8001P, EveryDrop Filter 4, EDR4XD1, EDR4RXD2, 4396395, UKF8001AXX-750, UKF8001AXX-200, UKF8001AXX, UKF9001, Sears or Kenmore 9006, 9992, 9005, 9084, Bosch BORPLFTR20, Viking RWFFR, 67006475, WF295, Puriclean II. Waterdrop is an independent brand. This Waterdrop WDP-F07 replacement water filter for Whirlpool refrigerator is comprehensively certified by NSF against NSF/ANSI 401, 53, 42 &372 Standards test from each component to the filter cartridge as a whole to achieve a supreme filtration performance. This filter has been strictly certified by NSF 401 to reduce phenytoin, naproxen, estrone and bisphenol A. Asides it has also been tested according to NSF/ANSI 53 standards to reduce lead, benzene, mercury, PFOA&PFOS in water. [Fast water flow, no leaks] Our mission is to supply refrigerator water filters that fit perfectly, impeccably engineered; this sets us apart from inferior models of replacement filters that can frequently result in water leakage problems. The microscopic pore sizes in our filter cartridges, made of superior materials, allow for smooth running, crisp, pure water. [Carefully chosen materials] Waterdrop uses coconut shell carbon blocks supplied from Sri Lanka that have enlarged surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon blocks. The filter cartridge is far more effective in reducing levels of chlorine, dirt, sediment, rust, and a wide range of heavy metals tested by a third-party laboratory. Based on our high attention to detail, we selected a BPA-free, food-grade housing for the filter that exceeds NSF 372 lead-free filtration certification. The Waterdrop brand is tried and trusted by more than 6 million US families to provide them with purer, cleaner, safer drinking water. We provide only high quality replacement filters that are certified as reducing a wide range of impurities by NSF 401, 53, 42 and 372. [Deep filtration] Waterdrop's refrigerator filters significantly reduce the levels of many different harmful substances in your water. The filter additionally allows through many of the beneficial minerals in water that are essential for health. [Regular filter changes] If you run replacement filter past the recommended date, something could accumulate and filtration performance could suffer. Because of this, we supply a complimentary set of installation stickers with every filter so that you can see at a glance when it needs replacing. We recommend that you should replace your filter after it has been used for 300 gallons or 6 months (this may vary dependent on the water condition in your area). [Professional standards] Our expert teams pride themselves on not letting any product or part of a product, down to the smallest components, leave our factory unless we are satisfied that they have reached and exceeded the very highest market standards. Our dedication doesn't just apply within the factory: we have a customer service team ready to answer your questions and deal with any problems 24/7. [More than just a business] Waterdrop is passionate about providing clean water for as many people as possible with lower environmental impact. We use cowhide corrugated box packaging, reducing the wastage other companies create with their materials. A percentage of the purchase price from every one of our filters is used to fund projects providing clean, pure water for African children who don't have access to safe water supplies. [Other compatible models] Compatible with FMM-2, 8171249, KBFS25ETSS01, WF295, CF5, EBL7770, RWF0900A, CWMF004, MPF15090, RFC0900A, PL-400, PG-8001, RWF1040, CLCH101, SGF-M9, SGF-M10, FL-RF07, AQF-FF07, WS607B, MB-F07","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r8PzfpJxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B0BXRM5JFJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-82393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXRM5JFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXRM5JFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
