window.products.push({"id":82735,"name":"Kognita 15 inch Beverage Refrigerator Beverage Cooler, 115 Cans Mini Fridge with Glass Door, Blue LED Lights, Small Drink Fridge with Clear Door,Lock,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VIyzEYoIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍹Large Capacity for Water & Cans:Powerful refrigeration chills drinks all the way down to 36°F (Temperature range: 36-61°F). The beverage refrigerator can hold up to 115 cans of drinks. The beverage cooler intelligent thermostat will maintain the interior at the temperature you want. Maintain the optimal temperature for your beverages. 🍹Fin-shaped Cooling Grille Holes :According to laboratory tests, the specially designed fin-shaped heat dissipation grille hole is more conducive to heat dissipation, high efficiency, energy saving and prolongs the service life of our mini fridge with glass door 🍹Touch Screen Panel and Energy Efficient Blue LED Lights: LED control display makes it easy to set temperature, providing perfect chilling temperature at all times! And when you open the glass door, The LED light will be totally on, again close the door, the LED light will be off. Control the brightness with the touch panel. The LED light can be adjusted to half brightness, then after the glass door is closed, the LED light will be still on to showcase your favorite beverages. 🍹Temperature Memory Function and Protective Your Beverage Design: The small beverage cooler restore the set temperature in the cooler after it is back on from power loss, which keeps your cans from going bad with increasing temperature. To hold your drink better. we choose 6 high-quality wire shelves. The shelf is removable and with a stopper; Don’t open the door frequently, particularly in warm/humid conditions. The beverage refrigerator cooler is suitable for indoor, with no noise 🍹Guarantee&Note: if you have any problem, you can contact us first, we will reply you within 24 hours. 1-year warranty included. NOTE: Before connecting the appliance to the power supply, let the unit stand upright for 4 hours, which will reduce the possibility of the cooling system malfunctioning due to improper handling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VIyzEYoIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kognita","source_asin":"B093L7B3VR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-82735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093L7B3VR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B093L7B3VR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
