window.products.push({"id":82784,"name":"45 x 52 mm GREEN Perforated Shrink Band for Hot Sauce Bottles and Other Liquid Bottles Fits 3/4\" to 1\" Diameter - Pack of 250","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E-VzKi5iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What you are purchasing here are 45 by 52mm (Layflat Dimensions) tamper seal shrink bands. These work best for Hot Sauce Bottles, Tubes and Other Narrow Containers. Directions: Place shrink band around the lid of the bottle that you will be shrinking it to. Apply heat with the use of a heat gun or heat tunnel. I don't recommend using a blow dryer; it's possible but not worth it unless you're only doing a small quantity of bottles. The shrink bands are easy to heat and durable. Have any questions at all about the shrink bands? Just send me a message and I'll get back to you as soon as I can!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E-VzKi5iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supplement and Supply","source_asin":"B07WV65L3D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-82784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WV65L3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WV65L3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":82785,"name":"Stainless Steel Outdoor Dryer Vent Cover Closure and Seal Hood with Natural Energy Saving, Exhaust Air Fit for 4\" Outside Siding Tube, Professional Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511PUFnTqxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description for Stainless Steel Outside Dryer Vent Closure Have you ever noticed that rooms containing your clothes dryer vent or any ventilation ducts are colder in winter and warmer in summer? Have you encountered the trouble of poor material and poor sealing of the vent hood of the dryer?  Do you need to change frequently? Then you need to buy a newly designed stainless steel Dryer Vent with Backflow prevention that can effective ventilation. 1.Package Contains: 1 X Dryer Vent COVER 1 X Working Gloves 1 X Screwdriver 6 X Screws 2.Applicable Size: Fits a 4-inch pipe diameter/vent opening. 3.How the Vent Cover Works? When the dryer is working, hot air enters and passes through the elbow of hood, which pushs the floating shuttle cup upward and allows air to escape from the bottom of the hood. When the dryer is not working, the floating shuttle cup will automatically fall down and be closed to form a completely sealed state. This design can prevent cold wind and other unwelcome things from entering the house through the ventilation holes. 4.Installation Instructions: Step 1 ASSEMBLE: Join the elbow’s smooth side into the vent body. Step 2 GET VENT OPENING READY: The existing vent pipe should be cut if necessary to have it protruded 1/2” from the outside wall. Clean lint accumulated in the vent pipe. Step 3 SET UP: Place the flat part of the elbow against the wall, align the holes and insert the 1/2” of the old vent pipe into the elbow. Mount the vent in a vertical position as in the picture below. Secure the 6 screws (included). To make sure the fit airtight enough, caulk with a bead of silicone around the square flanges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511PUFnTqxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEANHDAG","source_asin":"B0BCP9W7V1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-82785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCP9W7V1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCP9W7V1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
