window.products.push({"id":82862,"name":"ARGENTA Walnut Cone Coffee Filter Holder Storage, Wall-Mount Magnetic or Damage Free Adhesive, Gravity Arm Coffee Filter Storage Container for Hario, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bpCsG5daL._AC_SL1093_.jpg","description":"COFFEE FILTER HOLDER FOR A KITCHEN YOU CAN BE PROUD OF:  The Argenta coffee filter holder wall mount optimizes your kitchen space, bringing your cone coffee filters to eye level while you make your coffee.    MINIMALISTIC DESIGN, TOP-TIER MATERIALS, SKILLED CRAFTSMANSHIP:  Wall mount - Too many things on the counter drive us all up the wall. Our wall mount filter holder has zero counter-footprint and provides ample space below to store your other accessories. Rubber magnet on the back (Do you also find magnets very attractive?) A soft magnet covers 80% of the back. Attaches to metal surfaces without scratching them. No metal? No Problem! Our destruction-free adhesive patch for non-magnetic surfaces lets you attach the filter holder anywhere you want and can be removed without leaving a trace. Our Gravity Arm design won't let you down. The swiveling arm tightly holds coffee filters regardless if you're running low or if they're fully stacked Small size. Massive capacity. It can hold cone coffee filters from any brand like Hario, V60, Melitta, Chemex, and others  Satin brass rod - Just the right amount of shiny. The hexagonal brass rod with a debossed logo is polished and bent by a skilled artisan via manual operation. Walnut base - The material is just nuts. The black walnut base has a beautiful matte finish which is achieved by thoroughly finishing the wood without using varnish. Made from the world around us. We are committed to using only sustainable and recyclable materials in our packaging and products. Please recycle or compost. * Worry-Free Warranty 18-month warranty and easy-to-reach support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bpCsG5daL._AC_SL1093_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARGENTA","source_asin":"B07YKSHDDW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-82862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YKSHDDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YKSHDDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
