window.products.push({"id":82923,"name":"Kenmore Elite Top-Load Laundry 5.2 cu. ft. Washer & Electric Dryer Bundle in White, includes delivery and hookup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bpJ-pBEML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Item includes room of choice delivery, unboxing, item hook-up and free optional haul-away at checkout The large 5.2 cu. ft. capacity top-load washer can clean up to 29 towels in a single load, while the 7.3 cu. ft. dryer is perfect for family-sized laundry, from bedding and towels to jeans and school clothes. This dryer can even handle bulkier items, like rugs and puffy comforters. The washer has 14 cycles and 14 options which let you customize the settings for each load. Accela Wash activates a fast and powerful wash motion sequence to get clothes clean in just 29 minutes. This washer is designed with Smart Motion technology, which allows the direct drive motor to blend up to 6 different wash motions, providing customized care and cleaning to meet the needs of a variety of fabrics. Steam Treat virtually eliminates the need to pre-treat stains by tackling tough, set-in messes with the deep cleaning power of steam. The Cold Clean Cycle uses a cold water wash to clean clothes as effectively as warm water cycles, saving energy and money. The Allergen Cycle uses the power of steam to remove over 95% of common household allergens, like dust mites and pet dander, from even the most delicate fabrics. This dryer features 14 cycles with 11 options for exceptional versatility. The Dual Sensor System automatically detects moisture content in clothes to apply the right drying temperature and time to prevent over-drying, resulting in gentle fabric care. Cycle settings allow you to choose timed dry with 5 temperature settings, so you can select the best combination for each load. This Kenmore Elite dryer is packed with steam features to keep your fabrics fresh and reduce ironing. Accela Steam helps create more steam, improving the overall performance of steam cycles. Steam Refresh is perfect for reducing wrinkles and odors from fabrics, perfect for freshening up for date night or looking sharp for your morning meeting. Steam Sanitize eliminates 99% of bacteria and allergens, perfect for Teddy, bedding, baby items and pillows. Static Shield uses steam to reduce static shock, no more dryer sheets or getting zapped while folding. This washer also features Wrinkle Guard which keeps your clothes from wrinkling after the dry cycle by giving them a quick tumble after the cycle ends until you can grab your laundry. Item dimensions for the washer are length 28.38 by width 27.0 by height 38.0 inches. The dryer item dimensions are length 28.93 by width 27.0 by height 45.0 inches. Measure the available space to ensure the item will fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bpJ-pBEML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenmore","source_asin":"B0761N4D78","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-82923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0761N4D78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0761N4D78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
